  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/luynrs/justray/zipball/v1.8.0",
  "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n### 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- AmneziaWG\r\n  - YAY!!! Add AmneziaWG support, including imports from Amnezia profiles (for Amnezia App) and WireGuard links\r\n- TUI & Settings\r\n  - Rework settings navigation and keyboard controls\r\n  - Choose which node details to show: address, transport, and protocol\r\n  - Add settings-specific shortcuts and clearer save/discard hints\r\n  - Refresh colors across the TUI and CLI\r\n\r\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- Interface\r\n  - Fix rendering, scrolling, and mouse input in small terminals\r\n  - Improve text input and dialog dimming\r\n  - Prevent accidental subscription collapse on the first click\r\n- Imports & Compatibility\r\n  - Fix legacy Shadowsocks credentials and Hysteria2 bandwidth settings\r\n  - Support Trojan configurations without TLS\r\n  - Fix ShadowTLS server names and IPv6 address formatting\r\n  - Correct AmneziaWG protocol labels\r\n- Connections & Installation\r\n  - Improve WireGuard latency probing\r\n  - Fix connection cancellation and daemon startup handling\r\n  - Fix installation directory creation and permission checks\r\n\r\n### ♻️ Refactoring\r\n\r\n- Simplify settings, subscription refresh, and import parsing\r\n- Remove redundant code across the client, daemon, and engine\r\n\r\n### 📦 Dependencies\r\n\r\n- Updated sing-box, WireGuard, and other dependencies\r\n\r\nFull Changelog: [v1.7.3...v1.8.0](https://github.com/luynrs/justray/compare/v1.7.3...v1.8.0)"
}
